[I] C++ library for easy access to ALSA PCM devices

[T] zita-alsa-pcmi is a C++ library by Fons Adriaensen providing easy access
[T] to ALSA PCM devices, handling the operations to open, initialise and use
[T] an ALSA hw: device in memory mapped mode. Applications see PCM data as
[T] floating point samples, and the alsa_delay and alsa_loopback example
[T] programs are included.

[U] https://kokkinizita.linuxaudio.org/linuxaudio/

[A] Kokkini Zita
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/multimedia
[F] CROSS

